  "body": "There's a reason Eastern Beach has always held a special place in East Auckland. The salt air, the changing light across the water and the slower rhythm of coastal life create a feeling that is hard to replicate anywhere else. Here on The Esplanade, that feeling becomes part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nArchitecturally designed, this residence is ideally situated to make the most of its coastal setting, with sea views enjoyed from multiple areas of the home. High specification finishes, integrated Smart Home Technology and a thoughtful layout come together to create a home that feels as good to live in as it looks. Four bedrooms, three bathrooms and a layout designed around the way modern families actually live.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas forms the heart of the home, with natural light and a coastal outlook creates a welcoming space for everyday life and entertaining. A full bedroom and bathroom on this level adds valuable flexibility making it ideal for guests, teenagers, extended family or multigenerational living, with the option to enjoy its own sense of separation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, three further bedrooms continue the thoughtful design. The master bedroom is a private retreat, complete with its own ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. A ranch slider opens directly onto an exclusive balcony, where the morning begins with fresh sea air, beautiful inner Gulf views and perhaps a coffee while watching the sunrise.\r\n\r\nAt the centre of this level, a second living area creates another place to slow down and take in the surroundings. Wide ranch sliders open onto a wraparound deck, extending the living space outdoors and allowing the sea breeze to move naturally through the home. It's an inviting spot for morning coffee, afternoon relaxation or simply enjoying the ever-changing outlook. A separate family bathroom serves the remaining two bedrooms, completing a layout that balances shared spaces with the privacy every family needs.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, the location brings another layer of everyday enjoyment. Backing onto Rogers Park and the Clovelly walkway network, there is an abundance of green space and outdoor connection right on your doorstep. Eastern Beach playground and Macleans Park are just a few minutes' walk away, making it easy to turn the activities you normally save for weekends into part of everyday family life - from morning walks and playground adventures to running, cycling and time by the water.\r\n\r\nFor families with children, the schooling is another significant advantage. The home is zoned for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, providing a top educational pathway from primary through to secondary years.\r\n\r\nHere, the beach, parks, walking tracks and schools are not simply nearby amenities - they become part of the way your family lives, grows and makes memories together. A beautiful coastal home, surrounded by the spaces and opportunities that make family life richer.\r\nSome homes give you a place to live. Others give you a lifestyle you can feel every day.\r\n\r\nThis is Eastern Beach living, from the moment you wake up.\r\n\r\n*Find more properties you may like at https://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz",
